=== nowait does not wait for a longer mapping
divergent: the recorder types every key at once, so Vim sees ab whole and never waits; Jasper gets the keys one at a time, as typing does
text:
  one two three
  four five six
  seven eight nine
  ten eleven twelve
cursor: 1,1
keys: :nmap ab dd<CR>:nmap <lt>nowait> a x<CR>ab
--- expected
expect-text:
  ne two three
  four five six
  seven eight nine
  ten eleven twelve
expect-cursor: 1,1
expect-mode: normal

=== nowait on an older mapping still waits
text:
  one two three
  four five six
  seven eight nine
  ten eleven twelve
cursor: 1,1
keys: :nmap <lt>nowait> a x<CR>:nmap ab dd<CR>ab
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
  four five six
  seven eight nine
  ten eleven twelve
expect-cursor: 1,1
expect-mode: normal

